    {
      "source": "Return a bound <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>,\nconfigured with <a href=\"RootUriRequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>RootUriRequestExpectationManager</code></a> when possible.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>绑定，在可能的情况下配置为使用<a href=\"RootUriRequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>RootUriRequestExpectationManager</code></a>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>restTemplate</code> - the source REST template",
      "translation": "<code>restTemplate</code> - 源 REST 模板",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>expectationManager</code> - the source <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/RequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>RequestExpectationManager</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>expectationManager</code> - 源 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/RequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>RequestExpectationManager</code></a>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>",
      "translation": "已配置的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/RequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>RequestExpectationManager</code></a> to be used for binding with the specified\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>. If the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> is using a\n<a href=\"../RootUriTemplateHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RootUriTemplateHandler</code></a> then a <a href=\"RootUriRequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>RootUriRequestExpectationManager</code></a> is\nreturned, otherwise the source manager is returned unchanged.",
      "translation": "返回<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/RequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>RequestExpectationManager</code></a>用于与指定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>绑定。如果<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>使用的是<a href=\"../RootUriTemplateHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RootUriTemplateHandler</code></a>，则返回一个<a href=\"RootUriRequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>RootUriRequestExpectationManager</code></a>；否则，原样返回源管理器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/RequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>RequestExpectationManager</code></a> that strips the specified root URI from the request\nbefore verification. Can be used to simply test declarations when all REST calls start\nthe same way. For example: <pre class=\"code\">RestTemplate restTemplate = new RestTemplateBuilder().rootUri(\"https://example.com\").build();\nMockRestServiceServer server = RootUriRequestExpectationManager.bindTo(restTemplate);\nserver.expect(requestTo(\"/hello\")).andRespond(withSuccess());\nrestTemplate.getForEntity(\"/hello\", String.class);\n</pre>",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/RequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>RequestExpectationManager</code></a> 会在验证之前从请求中剥离指定的根 URI。当所有 REST 调用都以相同方式开始时，可用来简化声明测试。例如：<pre class=\"code\">RestTemplate restTemplate = new RestTemplateBuilder().rootUri(\"https://example.com\").build();\nMockRestServiceServer server = RootUriRequestExpectationManager.bindTo(restTemplate);\nserver.expect(requestTo(\"/hello\")).andRespond(withSuccess());\nrestTemplate.getForEntity(\"/hello\", String.class);\n</pre>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
